00:32:41.059 --> 00:32:42.827
STEVEN L WEBER, WHO IS A FORMER

00:32:42.894 --> 00:32:43.928
PRESIDENT OF SAN DIEGO STATE

00:32:43.995 --> 00:32:46.030
UNIVERSITY. HE DIED PEACEFULLY

00:32:46.097 --> 00:32:48.266
AT HIS HOME ON MARCH 17TH, 2024.

00:32:48.333 --> 00:32:51.069
IT WAS HIS 82ND BIRTHDAY. STEVE

00:32:51.135 --> 00:32:54.005
WAS BORN IN BOSTON ON SAINT

00:32:54.072 --> 00:32:55.173
PATRICK'S DAY IN 1942. AFTER THE

00:32:55.239 --> 00:32:58.443
DEATH OF HIS FATHER AT AGE NINE,

00:32:58.509 --> 00:32:59.610
THE FAMILY MOVED TO STONY RIDGE,

00:32:59.677 --> 00:33:02.347
OHIO, WHERE HE GREW UP. HE

00:33:02.413 --> 00:33:03.381
ATTENDED BOWLING GREEN STATE

00:33:03.448 --> 00:33:05.216
UNIVERSITY, WHERE HE EARNED A

00:33:05.283 --> 00:33:07.118
BACHELOR OF ARTS IN PHILOSOPHY

00:33:07.185 --> 00:33:08.219
IN 1964, AND WHILE AT BOWLING

00:33:08.286 --> 00:33:11.389
GREEN, HE FELL IN LOVE WITH HIS

00:33:11.456 --> 00:33:13.491
FUTURE WIFE, SUSAN KI¾M, AND THE

00:33:13.558 --> 00:33:16.427
COUPLE MARRIED IN 1965. STEVE

00:33:16.494 --> 00:33:17.462
PURSUED GRADUATE WORK AT THE

00:33:17.528 --> 00:33:19.731
UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO BOULDER

00:33:19.797 --> 00:33:20.998
AND EARNED A PHD IN PHILOSOPHY,

00:33:21.065 --> 00:33:23.201
PHILOSOPHY, EXCUSE ME FROM NOTRE

00:33:23.267 --> 00:33:26.637
DAME IN 1969. HE SERVED AS A

00:33:26.704 --> 00:33:27.839
TENURED PROFESSOR OF PHILOSOPHY

00:33:27.905 --> 00:33:29.674
AT THE UNIVERSITY OF MAINE, AND

00:33:29.741 --> 00:33:30.708
THEN MOVED ON TO HOLD

00:33:30.775 --> 00:33:31.576
ADMINISTRATIVE LEADERSHIP

00:33:31.642 --> 00:33:34.178
POSITIONS AT THE UNIVERSITY OF

00:33:34.245 --> 00:33:35.179
MAINE, FAIRFIELD UNIVERSITY, AND

00:33:35.246 --> 00:33:37.648
SAINT CLOUD UNIVERSITY. IN 1988,

00:33:37.715 --> 00:33:40.852
HE BECAME THE PRESIDENT OF STATE

00:33:40.918 --> 00:33:43.388
UNIVERSITY OF NEW YORK, OSWEGO,

00:33:43.454 --> 00:33:44.655
AND IN 1995 HE WAS APPOINTED AS

00:33:44.722 --> 00:33:46.791
THE INTERIM PROVOST PROVOST AT

00:33:46.858 --> 00:33:50.328
THE ENTIRE 64 CAMPUS OF THE SUNY

00:33:50.395 --> 00:33:55.166
SYSTEM. IN JULY OF 1996, HE WAS

00:33:55.233 --> 00:33:56.167
SELECTED AS THE SEVENTH

00:33:56.234 --> 00:33:57.268
PRESIDENT OF SAN DIEGO STATE

00:33:57.335 --> 00:33:58.770
UNIVERSITY, WHERE HE SERVED FOR

00:33:58.836 --> 00:34:01.839
15 VERY TRANSFORMATIVE YEARS,

00:34:01.906 --> 00:34:02.874
RETIRING IN 2011. DURING HIS

00:34:02.940 --> 00:34:05.543
TENURE, THE UNIVERSITY RAISED

00:34:05.610 --> 00:34:06.544
ACADEMIC STANDARDS. THEY LED THE

00:34:06.611 --> 00:34:08.946
NATION IN IMPROVED GRADUATION

00:34:09.013 --> 00:34:09.881
RATES, DIVERSIFIED THE STUDENT

00:34:09.947 --> 00:34:12.383
BODY, AND THEY PIONEERED

00:34:12.450 --> 00:34:13.351
PROGRAMS TO HELP MILITARY

00:34:13.418 --> 00:34:15.353
VETERANS AND FIRST GENERATION

00:34:15.420 --> 00:34:16.254
COLLEGE STUDENTS. THE CAMPUS

00:34:16.320 --> 00:34:18.723
EXPERIENCE AN UNPRECEDENTED

00:34:18.790 --> 00:34:19.657
EXPANSION OF FACILITIES,

00:34:19.724 --> 00:34:23.127
INCLUDING A NEW SPORTS ARENA, A

00:34:23.194 --> 00:34:25.763
TROLLEY STATION, AND NUMEROUS

00:34:25.830 --> 00:34:26.764
RESIDENCE HALLS AND ACADEMIC

00:34:26.831 --> 00:34:29.200
BUILDINGS. STEVE WAS RENOWNED

00:34:29.267 --> 00:34:30.401
FOR HIS COLLABORATIVE LEADERSHIP

00:34:30.468 --> 00:34:32.837
STYLE, HIS COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT,

00:34:32.904 --> 00:34:35.606
AND HIS EFFORTS TO MAKE SDSU A

00:34:35.673 --> 00:34:36.707
TOP RESEARCH INSTITUTION. HE WAS

00:34:36.774 --> 00:34:39.010
A DRIVING FORCE BEHIND THE

00:34:39.076 --> 00:34:43.181
CAMPAIGN FOR SDSU THAT RAISED

00:34:43.247 --> 00:34:44.282
$800 MILLION IN DONATIONS OVER

00:34:44.348 --> 00:34:46.784
THE COURSE OF TEN YEARS, HE

00:34:46.851 --> 00:34:47.852
DONATED $100,000 TO START THE

00:34:47.919 --> 00:34:50.421
STEVEN WEBER FUND FOR

00:34:50.488 --> 00:34:51.422
EXCELLENCE, AN ENDOWMENT TO

00:34:51.489 --> 00:34:53.558
SUPPORT FACULTY IN THE

00:34:53.624 --> 00:34:54.625
UNIVERSITY'S COLLEGE OF ARTS AND

00:34:54.692 --> 00:34:57.361
LETTERS. AFTER RETIREMENT, HE

00:34:57.428 --> 00:34:58.463
MOVED TO MAINE, LATER ON TO

00:34:58.529 --> 00:35:00.331
VIRGINIA AND NEW JERSEY, BUT HE

00:35:00.398 --> 00:35:01.365
CONTINUED TO SUPPORT SDSU,

00:35:01.432 --> 00:35:04.902
VISITING SAN DIEGO OFTEN, AND HE

00:35:04.969 --> 00:35:06.103
COULD BE SEEN CHEERING ON THE

00:35:06.170 --> 00:35:07.238
SAN DIEGO STATE UNIVERSITY

00:35:07.305 --> 00:35:10.741
AZTECS AT SPORTING EVENTS. HE

00:35:10.808 --> 00:35:12.543
ACTIVELY CAMPAIGNED FOR THE

00:35:12.610 --> 00:35:13.544
SUCCESSFUL 2018 BALLOT MEASURE

00:35:13.611 --> 00:35:16.214
TO SELL THE MISSION VALLEY

00:35:16.280 --> 00:35:17.415
STADIUM SITE TO SDSU FOR CAMPUS

00:35:17.482 --> 00:35:20.017
EXPANSION, INCLUDING

00:35:20.084 --> 00:35:23.087
CONSTRUCTION OF A NEW STADIUM.

00:35:23.154 --> 00:35:24.322
IN 2021, HE WAS DIAGNOSED WITH

00:35:24.388 --> 00:35:27.125
ALS, AN EXCRUCIATING DISEASE,

00:35:27.191 --> 00:35:30.261
AND IN SPITE OF HIS PHYSICAL

00:35:30.328 --> 00:35:31.295
DECLINE, HE ALWAYS MAINTAINED A

00:35:31.362 --> 00:35:33.631
POSITIVE SPIRIT AND PUBLISHED A

00:35:33.698 --> 00:35:34.732
COLLECTION OF INSPIRING ESSAYS,

00:35:34.799 --> 00:35:38.035
REFLECTIONS IN THE MIRROR OF

00:35:38.102 --> 00:35:40.137
LIFE. JUST LAST YEAR, SUSAN

00:35:40.204 --> 00:35:41.305
WEBER, HIS WIFE OF 49 YEARS,

00:35:41.372 --> 00:35:44.208
PASSED AWAY IN 2014. STEVE IS

00:35:44.275 --> 00:35:46.310
SURVIVED BY HIS LOVING COMPANION

00:35:46.377 --> 00:35:47.311
STEPHANIE RALPH, HIS SONS MATT

00:35:47.378 --> 00:35:50.248
AND RICK, GRANDSONS COLIN AND

00:35:50.314 --> 00:35:51.883
AARON, HIS BROTHERS JOHN AND

00:35:51.949 --> 00:35:54.051
ROGER. STEVE WAS A TRUE

00:35:54.118 --> 00:35:55.052
PHILOSOPHER KNOWN FOR HIS

00:35:55.119 --> 00:35:57.088
INTELLECT, HIS ANALYTICAL MIND,

00:35:57.154 --> 00:36:00.057
HIS CONTEMPLATIVE NATURE, VISION

00:36:00.124 --> 00:36:01.092
AND GRACE, GREAT PATIENCE AND

00:36:01.158 --> 00:36:04.862
HONESTY. SO, COLLEAGUES, I WOULD

00:36:04.929 --> 00:36:06.030
ASK THAT WE ADJOURN TODAY IN

00:36:06.097 --> 00:36:07.498
MEMORY OF PRESIDENT STEVEN

00:36:07.565 --> 00:36:08.499
WEBER, A REMARKABLE SERVANT

00:36:08.566 --> 00:36:11.502
LEADER, A TRUE AZTEC FOR LIFE.

00:36:11.569 --> 00:36:14.272
SAN DIEGO STATE UNIVERSITY AND

00:36:14.338 --> 00:36:15.439
THE SAN DIEGO COMMUNITY, THE

00:36:15.506 --> 00:36:16.541
STATE OF CALIFORNIA ARE ALL

00:36:16.607 --> 00:36:18.309
DEEPLY SADDENED, AND WE

00:36:18.376 --> 00:36:21.412
BENEFITED FROM HIS CAREER AND

00:36:21.479 --> 00:36:22.580
HIS SERVICE. THANK YOU, SENATOR.

00:36:22.647 --> 00:36:24.515
THANK YOU FOR THOSE LOVELY

00:36:24.582 --> 00:36:25.616
WORDS. PLEASE BRING HIS NAME

00:36:25.683 --> 00:36:26.684
FORWARD SO THAT HE MAY BE

00:36:26.751 --> 00:36:27.885
PROPERLY MEMORIALIZED IN THE

00:36:27.952 --> 00:36:30.021
JOURNAL, SENATOR HURTADO, YOU'RE

00:36:30.087 --> 00:36:33.624
RECOGNIZED. MADAM PRESIDENT,

00:36:33.691 --> 00:36:37.395
MEMBERS, I RISE TODAY TO ADJOURN

