TRUJILLO FROM THE CITY OF ARVIN,

00:36:41.432 --> 00:36:43.000
SURROUNDED BY HER THREE LOVING

00:36:43.067 --> 00:36:44.068
DAUGHTERS. MAYOR TRUJILLO PASSED

